<section class="ch-s ch-mt" id="match"><div class="ch-w"><div class="ch-sh"><p class="ch-tag">Tool one</p><h2 class="rv">Chutney matcher</h2><p class="ch-p">Pick what is on your plate. We suggest a chutney that balances it, and show its flavour profile.</p></div>
<div class="ch-mt-g"><div><div class="ch-dish" id="mt-d" role="group" aria-label="Dish"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Samosa</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Dosa</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Pakora</button><button type="button" data-v="3">Grilled fish</button><button type="button" data-v="4">Cheese toast</button><button type="button" data-v="5">Rice &amp; dal</button></div><figure class="ch-mt-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509359149003-657ef23eaf04?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=300&q=75" alt="four steel spoons holding different condiments" width="520" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="ch-mt-r" aria-live="polite"><div class="ch-mt-top"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 200" class="ch-jar ch-mj" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="ch-mj-c"><path d="M30 50h100v120q0 20-20 20H50q-20 0-20-20z"/></clipPath></defs><rect x="40" y="18" width="80" height="26" rx="5" class="lid"/><path d="M30 50h100v120q0 20-20 20H50q-20 0-20-20z" class="gl"/><g clip-path="url(#ch-mj-c)"><rect x="20" y="60" width="120" height="140" class="fill" style="fill:#2F8F5B"/><path class="wv" d="M0 64q20-10 40 0t40 0 40 0 40 0 40 0v20H0z" style="fill:#2F8F5B"/></g><rect x="44" y="104" width="72" height="40" rx="4" class="lb"/><text x="80" y="129"></text></svg><div><p class="ch-mt-k">Try it with</p><h3 id="mt-t"></h3><p id="mt-w"></p></div></div><ul class="ch-flav"><li><span>Sweet</span><div class="ch-bar"><i id="mf-0"></i></div></li><li><span>Sour</span><div class="ch-bar"><i id="mf-1"></i></div></li><li><span>Spicy</span><div class="ch-bar"><i id="mf-2"></i></div></li><li><span>Herby</span><div class="ch-bar"><i id="mf-3"></i></div></li><li><span>Nutty</span><div class="ch-bar"><i id="mf-4"></i></div></li></ul><p class="ch-mt-n" id="mt-n"></p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ch-s ch-bt" id="batch"><div class="ch-w ch-bt-g"><div><p class="ch-tag">Tool two</p><h2 class="rv">Batch &amp; heat planner</h2><p class="ch-p">Choose a chutney, how many jars you want and how hot you like it. The recipe card scales to match.</p>
<p class="ch-lb">Chutney</p><div class="ch-dish ch-dish-s" id="bt-r" role="group" aria-label="Chutney"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Mint &amp; coriander</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Tamarind &amp; date</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Sweet mango</button><button type="button" data-v="3">Tomato &amp; onion</button></div>
<label class="ch-lb" for="bt-j">Jars (about 1 cup each): <b id="bt-jv">2</b></label><input type="range" id="bt-j" min="1" max="8" value="2" class="ch-rng">
<label class="ch-lb" for="bt-h">Heat: <b id="bt-hv">Medium</b></label><input type="range" id="bt-h" min="0" max="4" value="2" class="ch-rng ch-rng-h"><div class="ch-chilis" id="bt-c" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
<div class="ch-card" aria-live="polite"><div class="ch-card-h"><span class="ch-sc">recipe card</span><b id="bt-t">Mint &amp; coriander</b><em id="bt-k">Fresh &middot; keeps 3 days</em></div><ul class="ch-ing" id="bt-i"></ul><p class="ch-card-m" id="bt-m"></p></div></div></section>

<section class="ch-s ch-in"><div class="ch-w"><div class="ch-sh ch-sh-c"><p class="ch-tag">In the pot</p><h2 class="rv">Four things every chutney needs</h2></div><ul class="ch-in-l stg"><li class="rv" style="--r:-3deg"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1771229389277-a0a7546913f9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=320&h=320&q=75" alt="tamarind pods hanging from a tree branch" width="320" height="320" loading="lazy"></figure><b>Tamarind</b><p>Sour and fruity, the backbone of dark, sticky chutneys.</p></li><li class="rv" style="--r:2deg"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551437424-8d2ccf214a19?auto=format&fit=crop&w=320&h=320&q=75" alt="assorted spices in bowls on a dark wooden surface" width="320" height="320" loading="lazy"></figure><b>Spices</b><p>Cumin, fennel, nigella and chilli, toasted until fragrant.</p></li><li class="rv" style="--r:-2deg"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1718018486246-adfaec1bdf03?auto=format&fit=crop&w=320&h=320&q=75" alt="three wooden spoons filled with spices" width="320" height="320" loading="lazy"></figure><b>Sugar &amp; jaggery</b><p>Balance the sour notes and help cooked chutneys keep.</p></li><li class="rv" style="--r:3deg"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788618992931-a1289ef2da41?auto=format&fit=crop&w=320&h=320&q=75" alt="metal bowls of chopped tomatoes and onions" width="320" height="320" loading="lazy"></figure><b>Fresh produce</b><p>Tomatoes, onions, herbs and fruit, chopped by hand.</p></li></ul></div></section>

<section class="ch-band"><div class="ch-w ch-band-g"><figure class="rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789991895360-ad65a685485a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=420&q=75" alt="a round flatbread served with curry and green chutney" width="600" height="420" loading="lazy"></figure><div class="rv"><p class="ch-sc">a little goes a long way</p><p class="ch-band-q">One spoon of green chutney can wake up a whole plate of flatbread and curry.</p></div></div></section>

